ying the punishment measures, which the context already says aren't sufficient because they don't address the heart. So, just specifying them more might not solve the problem.\n\nTherefore, the author probably thinks that the best way is to touch the depths of their heart, which is option B.\n</think>\n\nThe correct option is: B",
