xt doesn't say anything about the companies stopping operations. It just says they're uncompetitive. They might still operate but not gain many customers. So, D isn't necessarily true.\n\nSo, the only option that must be true is A because the government company survives despite poor service, showing that excellent service isn't a requirement for survival.\n</think>\n\nThe correct option is: A",
