in idea is that reason is the most reliable tool for making judgments, which is option A.\n</think>\n\nThe passage emphasizes that reason is the most reliable tool for making judgments, especially in complex situations. It contrasts reason with irrational tools and mentions established methods and principles to support this. Among the options, A directly captures this main idea.\n\nThe correct option is: A",
