ld try to make it popular with at least one group? Well, if it's already not popular with one, maybe we don't need to. But the context doesn't specify that we have to make it popular; it just states the condition. So, I'm not sure if B is necessarily true. It might be a suggestion, but not a logical conclusion.\n\nSo, putting it all together, the correct answer seems to be D.\n</think>\n\nThe correct option is: D",
