artially correct but not as precise as Option A.\n\nComparing all options, Option A directly addresses the importance of after-sales service, which is the main point the passage is making. The other options either don't address service specifically or make broader statements that aren't as accurate based on the context.\n</think>\n\nThe correct option is: A",
