make sure. Is there any way this could be political? Maybe if the pedlar is part of a political movement, but the question doesn't specify that. It just says a man and a pedlar bargaining. So it's a private transaction, not involving public political power or rights. Therefore, it's not a political struggle.\n</think>\n\nThe correct option is: D",
