ns know very little about neutrinos. The context says they are the least known of the basic particles because they don't interact much. So D is accurate.\n\nSo, the incorrect understanding would be option C because the context only says they \"may be one of the most common,\" not that they are definitely the most common. Therefore, the answer should be C.\n</think>\n\nThe correct option is: C",
