 rather than the main point.\n\nD) Appreciation of ancient poems helps cultivate environmental awareness.\n- The paragraph explicitly states that through poetry, people can feel nature, experience life, and develop a sense of responsibility to protect nature. This seems to directly align with option D.\n\nSo, the paragraph is explaining how appreciating ancient poetry can help people develop an awareness of environmental protection. Therefore, the correct answer should be D.\n</think>\n\nThe paragraph discusses how ancient poetry can be used to foster a connection with nature and environmental responsibility. It highlights that while fewer people deeply understand poetry, popularizing it can help cultivate environmental awareness. This aligns with option D, which states that appreciating ancient poems helps cultivate environmental awareness.\n\nThe correct option is: D",
