nt. But the options only have one correct answer, so I need to pick the best one.\n\nAlternatively, maybe the correct answer is A because it's a linear, logical progression without any imaginative or associative thinking beyond the immediate effect. The others involve more creative connections.\n</think>\n\nThe correct option is: A",
